## Правила зависимостей

Разрешенные зависимости:

entrypoint → orchestrator  
entrypoint → config  
api → orchestrator  
api → config  

container → config  
container → mappers  

orchestrator → services  
orchestrator → mappers  

services → models  
services → entity  

mappers → entity  

models → entity  

Запрещенные зависимости:

container → api  
orchestrator → api  
services → api  
adapters → api  
mappers → api  
entity → api  

orchestrator → container

services → orchestrator  
services → mappers  

adapters → services  
adapters → orchestrator  
adapters → mappers  

mappers → services  
mappers → adapters  

entity → services  
entity → adapters  
entity → mappers  

config → orchestrator  
config → services  
config → adapters  

